From: Eden Linux <cports@local>
Subject: [PATCH] default to the Eden repository mirror

The bootstrap and dependency resolution must never fall back to the Chimera
repository. The local config sets this explicitly, but keep the engine default
consistent so a missing [apk] section cannot reach Chimera.
---
 src/runner.py | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/runner.py b/src/runner.py
--- a/src/runner.py
+++ b/src/runner.py
@@ -9,6 +9,6 @@
 
 opt_apkcmd = "apk"
-opt_apkrepo = "https://repo.chimera-linux.org/current"
+opt_apkrepo = "https://repos.eden-linux.org"
 opt_bwcmd = "bwrap"
 opt_cflags = "-O2"
 opt_cxxflags = "-O2"
